---
// Work style and preferences section
---

<section id="work-style" class="work-style">
  <div class="work-style-container">
    <h2>How I Work Best</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">My working preferences and collaboration style</p>

    <div class="work-grid">
      <div class="work-item">
        <h3>🎯 Clear Goals & Priorities</h3>
        <p>I thrive when objectives, constraints, and success metrics are well-defined upfront.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item">
        <h3>🤝 Autonomous Execution</h3>
        <p>I work best with teams that trust my expertise to make decisions within agreed parameters.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item">
        <h3>📊 Measurable Outcomes</h3>
        <p>I focus on delivering results grounded in data, metrics, and evidence-based decisions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item">
        <h3>💬 Consistent Communication</h3>
        <p>Regular sync points keep work aligned and prevent misunderstandings.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item">
        <h3>⏰ Flexible Collaboration</h3>
        <p>Compatible time zones with limited recurring late-night meetings. Async-friendly.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="work-item">
        <h3>🚀 Ownership & Accountability</h3>
        <p>I prefer end-to-end ownership with clear accountability and the ability to propose solutions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="engagement-types">
      <h3>Engagement Models</h3>
      <div class="models-grid">
        <div class="model">
          <h4>Project-Based</h4>
          <p>Dedicated work on a defined scope with clear deliverables and timeline.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="model">
          <h4>Part-Time / Retainer</h4>
          <p>Ongoing collaboration on an agreed schedule, flexible to your evolving needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="model">
          <h4>Technical Advisory</h4>
          <p>Strategic guidance and decision-making support on architecture and technical direction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="model">
          <h4>Mentoring</h4>
          <p>Regular sessions focused on skill-building, career growth, and technical knowledge transfer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .work-style {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f1e 0%, #1a1a2e 100%);
    color: white;
  }

  .work-style-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .work-style h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
    color: #b0b0c0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
  }

  .work-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .work-item {
    background: rgba(100, 213, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #64d5ff;
  }

  .work-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: white;
  }

  .work-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #b0b0c0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .engagement-types {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
  }

  .engagement-types h3 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
  }

  .models-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .model {
    background: rgba(100, 213, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(100, 213, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .model h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: #64d5ff;
  }

  .model p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #b0b0c0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .work-style {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .work-style h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .models-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
